# XenithOS Console's apps in the desktop's Apps menu. Every app of XenithOS Console's that's on
# its home screen also has an entry in the Apps menu, and opens on the desktop by itself
# (/usr/lib/xenithos-desktop/console-apps makes the entries, console-app starts the app). This
# says which group an app goes in (a Categories line, as in any .desktop file) and what the menu
# says about it. An app that isn't named here goes under Games with no words of its own.
#
#   app      categories                      what the Apps menu says about it
volt     Game;ArcadeGame;                A light-trail game with a leaderboard on XenithOS Cloud
doom     Game;ActionGame;                The classic shooter
tube     AudioVideo;Video;Player;        Videos from YouTube
photos   Graphics;Viewer;Photography;    Your pictures, full screen
minenest Game;Network;                   Minecraft servers on this PC, with mods and plugins
